  "bio": "Artists\nSuppliers\nAbout\nDiscover the artistry of angles and shapes at Black Heart Tattoo Studio, an avant-garde haven for geometric tattoo enthusiasts in Munich, Germany. Connect with our dedicated team of artists—Katharina, Tom, Kali, and Erika—each with a unique flair for crisp, precise designs that echo the heart's beat. Book by appointment at info@blackheartmunich.de to embark on your next bold, symmetrical ink adventure with us. 🖤\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Munich, Bavaria, Germany\n\nTattoostudio \nTermine nach Vereinbarung  \n@katharina.menne.tattoo\n@icedbabygirrl \n@eriksler",
